From 8aedb90aae2831c2b32acc1000b8587285616b89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hauke Mehrtens <hauke.mehrtens@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2020 15:08:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-8285: Copy mcc filter driver from pon_mcc_drv
 project

This is more or less only coping the driver without many changes and add
them to the make and KConfig system.
---
 drivers/net/datapath/Kconfig                       |   1 +
 drivers/net/datapath/mcast_bridge_filter/Kconfig   |  11 ++
 drivers/net/datapath/mcast_bridge_filter/Makefile  |   2 +
 .../mcast_bridge_filter/mcast_bridge_filter.c      | 180 +++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/net/ethernet/lantiq/Makefile               |   1 +
 include/net/mcast_bridge_filter.h                  |  21 +++
 6 files changed, 216 insertions(+)

